{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_30","type":"agent_message","text":"The assembled game is running on software WebGPU, and the first full AI Hub sessions pass. Testing also caught a co-op visibility gap: remote players couldn’t see the finale’s drones and projectiles. I’m fixing that and adding two nods to the 1979 game: a telephone-booth identity change and a bridge-restoration bonus.\n"}}
